# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card tp4/next-2 window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/next-2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here
# names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The window's jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed
# from this branch.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG names the image N0 builds from this same commit; a later commit needs a new tag.
# C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-2 is a PLACEHOLDER: the driver of the window may substitute it (in every template) once the image is built
# from the pushed branch; the driver's IMAGE_TAG env overrides it.
# R0: the BASELINE of R3: c2-packed-tp4-speed-strace (both verify audits OFF, the tail caps ON, no instruments, no stall watch, hang fix A
# QWEN_FAST_PACKED_SAMPLER_IN_TRACE=1, NO request-shard flag). Not the bare c2-packed-tp4-speed: without a hang fix it deadlocked in
# concurrent8_code on tp4-serve-6 (S0t, the engine-build shape) and took a card's ARC down, while -speed-strace passed the same tests (STt).
# So R0 against R3 reads the cost of fix B against fix A, both audits off
# on the same image tp4-next-2 and the same tests as R3, so the lever's cost is read paired, on one image in one window under the same rig
# load: sequential step time and coding decode rate of R3 against this job's. Run it just before R3 (R0, R3, R0b, R3b is an ABAB; R0b repeats this job before R3b). Run only after all five R1 runs completed. Not a stop job.
# Duration (estimate): 25 min.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-2
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-speed-strace
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent4_code,concurrent4_code_equal,concurrent8_code
